Agentic Video Intelligence: A Flexible Framework for Advanced Video Exploration and Understanding (https://arxiv.org/html/2511.14446v1)
citeturn6528view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({"ref_id":"turn6523view2","lineno":240}); Total lines: 499
L196: ### 3.4 Agent Runtime
L197: 
L198: Algorithm 1 AVI Agent Execution
L199: 
L200: 1: Video database $\mathcal{K}$, Question $q$, Max iterations $N$
L201: 
L202: 2: Answer $a$
L203: 
L204: 3: Initialize state $\mathcal{S}_{0}\leftarrow\{\text{messages}:[q],\text{phase}:\text{retrieve}\}$
L205: 
L206: 4: $t\leftarrow 0$
L207: 
L208: 5: while $t<N$ and not terminated do
L209: 
L210: 6:   if $\mathcal{S}_{t}.\text{phase}=\text{retrieve}$ then
L211: 
L212: 7:    $\mathcal{A}_{t}^{r}\sim\pi_{r}(\cdot|\mathcal{S}_{t})$ $\triangleright$ Select retrieval action
L213: 8:    if $\mathcal{A}_{t}^{r}\in\mathcal{T}_{r}$ then
L214: 
L215: 9:      $\mathcal{O}_{t}^{r}\leftarrow\text{Execute}(\mathcal{A}_{t}^{r},\mathcal{K})$ $\triangleright$ Query database
L216: 
L217: 10:    else
L218: 
L219: 11:      $\mathcal{S}_{t}.\text{phase}\leftarrow\text{perceive}$ $\triangleright$ Switch phase
L220: 
L221: 12:    end if
L222: 
L223: 13:   else if $\mathcal{S}_{t}.\text{phase}=\text{perceive}$ then
L224: 
L225: 14:    $\mathcal{A}_{t}^{p}\sim\pi_{p}(\cdot|\mathcal{S}_{t})$ $\triangleright$ Select perception action
L226: 15:    if $\mathcal{A}_{t}^{p}\in\mathcal{T}_{p}$ then
L227: 
L228: 16:      $\mathcal{O}_{t}^{p}\leftarrow\text{Execute}(\mathcal{A}_{t}^{p},\mathcal{V})$ $\triangleright$ Process frames
L229: 
L230: 17:    else
L231: 
L232: 18:      $\mathcal{S}_{t}.\text{phase}\leftarrow\text{review}$ $\triangleright$ Switch phase
L233: 
L234: 19:    end if
L235: 
L236: 20:    $\mathcal{S}_{t+1}\leftarrow\text{UpdateState}(\mathcal{S}_{t},\mathcal{A}_{t},\mathcal{O}_{t})$
L237: 
L238: 21:    $t\leftarrow t+1$
L239: 
L240: 22:   end if
L241: 
L242: 23:   if $\pi_{v}(\mathcal{S}_{t})=True$ then
L243: 24:    return Output($\mathcal{S}_{t}$) $\triangleright$ Output final answer
L244: 
L245: 25:   else
L246: 
L247: 26:    $\mathcal{S}_{t}.\text{phase}\leftarrow\text{perceive}$ $\triangleright$ Re-perceive
L248: 
L249: 27:   end if
L250: 
L251: 28: end while
L252: 
L253: 29: return ForcedAnswer($\mathcal{S}_{t}$) $\triangleright$ Fallback
L254: Table 1: Comparison with state-of-the-art methods on video understanding benchmarks. We evaluate accuracy (%) on LVBench, VideoMME-Long (without subtitles), and LongVideoBench, as well as temporal grounding performance (mIoU) on Charades-STA. Bold indicates best results. We divide all methods by whether is agentic system or trained by RL.
