L147: [Input] About arXivLabs
L148: # arXivLabs: experimental projects with community collaborators
L149: 
L150: arXivLabs is a framework that allows collaborators to develop and share new arXiv features directly on our website.
L151: 
L152: Both individuals and organizations that work with arXivLabs have embraced and accepted our values of openness, community, excellence, and user data privacy. arXiv is committed to these values and only works with partners that adhere to them.

